### [Ashet Express communication fixed]($section.id('2026-01-10'))

Did someone order a slideshow?

> []($block.attrs('pictures','large'))
> []($video.siteAsset('img/devlog/2026/2026-01-10_slideshow.webm').controls(true))

I finally fixed the bug that mouse movement would overrun the kernel and crash it.

But the GUI branch merge contained a strong simplification of the rendering core,
which is now incredibly slow.

Thus, it flickers and flackers and everything lags on the real hardware. This is
not supposed to stay that way.
